Error [E0205]: Cannot edit through this read-only `SharedGuard` view
  --> returned_public_guard_is_read_only_without_write_helper_access.jet:9:11
    |
  9 |     guard.value += 1
    |           ^^^^^
 Why: A public guard type outside its acquisition site preserves read access unless a helper explicitly receives it with write access
 Fix: Keep the edit at the acquisition site, or pass the guard to a helper with the write-access marker `&`, such as `&guard: SharedGuard<T>`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0205
